{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addPrivate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"privateSize","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When an object is allocated, the private structures for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the type and all of its parent types are allocated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"sequentially in the same memory block as the public","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"structures, and are zero-filled.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note that the accumulated size of the private structures of","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a type and all its parent types cannot exceed 64 KiB."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This function should be called in the type’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"class_init()"},{"type":"text","text":" function."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The private structure can be retrieved using the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"G_TYPE_INSTANCE_GET_PRIVATE()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" macro.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example shows attaching a private structure","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"MyObjectPrivate to an object MyObject defined in the standard","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"GObject fashion in the type’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"class_init()"},{"type":"text","text":" function."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note the use of a structure member “priv” to avoid the overhead"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of repeatedly calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MY_OBJECT_GET_PRIVATE()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"(C Language Example):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"C","code":["typedef struct _MyObject        MyObject;","typedef struct _MyObjectPrivate MyObjectPrivate;","","struct _MyObject {"," GObject parent;",""," MyObjectPrivate *priv;","};","","struct _MyObjectPrivate {","  int some_field;","};","","static void","my_object_class_init (MyObjectClass *klass)","{","  g_type_class_add_private (klass, sizeof (MyObjectPrivate));","}","","static void","my_object_init (MyObject *my_object)","{","  my_object->priv = G_TYPE_INSTANCE_GET_PRIVATE (my_object,","                                                 MY_TYPE_OBJECT,","                                                 MyObjectPrivate);","  \/\/ my_object->priv->some_field will be automatically initialised to 0","}","","static int","my_object_get_some_field (MyObject *my_object)","{","  MyObjectPrivate *priv;","","  g_return_val_if_fail (MY_IS_OBJECT (my_object), 0);","","  priv = my_object->priv;","","  return priv->some_field;","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"add_private is deprecated:","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Use the G_ADD_PRIVATE() macro with the "},{"code":"G_DEFINE_*","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"family of macros to add instance private data to a type","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers a private structure for an instantiatable type."}],"metadata":{"title":"addPrivate(privateSize:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"GLibObject"}],"extendedModule":"GLibObject","externalID":"s:10GLibObject17TypeClassProtocolPAAE10addPrivate11privateSizeySi_t